{"id":5643,"date":"2025-09-13T13:52:53","date_gmt":"2025-09-13T06:52:53","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=5643"},"modified":"2025-09-25T20:29:31","modified_gmt":"2025-09-25T13:29:31","slug":"cach-xoa-tai-khoan-shopee-pay","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/kien-thuc-shopee\/cach-xoa-tai-khoan-shopee-pay\/","title":{"rendered":"C\u00e1ch xo\u00e1 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ShopeePay chi ti\u1ebft v\u00e0 an to\u00e0n"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"YuU3dsAGGoeHeRxid4Rl3ey3gIe\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vrchdj85oohqpExI3i3lTkHwgMg\">V\u00ec m\u1ed9t l\u00fd do c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n n\u00e0o \u0111\u00f3, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 mu\u1ed1n t\u00ecm c\u00e1ch xo\u00e1 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ShopeePay c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch d\u1ee9t \u0111i\u1ec3m. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t thao t\u00e1c quan tr\u1ecdng li\u00ean quan tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp \u0111\u1ebfn th\u00f4ng tin t\u00e0i ch\u00ednh c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u00f2i h\u1ecfi s\u1ef1 c\u1ea9n tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 tu\u00e2n th\u1ee7 \u0111\u00fang quy tr\u00ecnh. Vi\u1ec7c qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd t\u00e0i s\u1ea3n s\u1ed1 nh\u01b0 v\u00ed \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed c\u0169ng quan tr\u1ecdng nh\u01b0 qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd m\u1ed9t gian h\u00e0ng online, n\u01a1i c\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c b\u00e0i b\u1ea3n t\u1eeb <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong> c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PhDldGja8ofZeOxit6glVVEFgZf\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-B20KdDywdonIo9xKRFZloCG5gJd\">C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 x\u00f3a t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ShopeePay v\u0129nh vi\u1ec5n kh\u00f4ng?<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EXh5dVHWhozioexYN9pl7AOhgph\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-Bip0dsKPdo57NlxzIptlKFcqg0d\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;d915fa37-d31f-4d7f-b540-cb9725a3ef12&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FD8e5bCqqsoauVyx8QuglOH2zgOe%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;D8e5bCqqsoauVyx8QuglOH2zgOe&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:337087,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5644\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5644\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5644\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Co-the-xoa-tai-khoan-ShopeePay-vinh-vien-khong.png\" alt=\"C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 x\u00f3a t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ShopeePay v\u0129nh vi\u1ec5n kh\u00f4ng\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Co-the-xoa-tai-khoan-ShopeePay-vinh-vien-khong.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Co-the-xoa-tai-khoan-ShopeePay-vinh-vien-khong-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Co-the-xoa-tai-khoan-ShopeePay-vinh-vien-khong-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Co-the-xoa-tai-khoan-ShopeePay-vinh-vien-khong-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Co-the-xoa-tai-khoan-ShopeePay-vinh-vien-khong-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5644\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 x\u00f3a t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ShopeePay v\u0129nh vi\u1ec5n kh\u00f4ng<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B6M7dbTEgoobohxaZePleDbzgNf\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IxBBdihHCoWfkBxXwa3l6uTyg3d\">C\u00e2u tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi l\u00e0 <strong>C\u00f3<\/strong>, b\u1ea1n ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 y\u00eau c\u1ea7u x\u00f3a v\u0129nh vi\u1ec5n t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ShopeePay c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tgb6d1foZognh0x54uDlDsnIgDg\">Tuy nhi\u00ean, b\u1ea1n kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 t\u1ef1 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n thao t\u00e1c n\u00e0y trong ph\u1ea7n c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t c\u1ee7a \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng. Qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh n\u00e0y \u0111\u00f2i h\u1ecfi s\u1ef1 can thi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 x\u00e1c minh t\u1eeb b\u1ed9 ph\u1eadn Ch\u0103m s\u00f3c kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng (CSKH) c\u1ee7a ShopeePay \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o t\u00ednh b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt v\u00e0 ch\u1eafc ch\u1eafn r\u1eb1ng ch\u00ednh ch\u1ee7 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n l\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u01b0a ra y\u00eau c\u1ea7u.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O442d8GlWo9CkrxvbVilNAotgBf\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-C022dGofdoC8dFx6Will3XIUgpn\">4 \u0110i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n b\u1eaft bu\u1ed9c c\u1ea7n chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi x\u00f3a v\u00ed ShopeePay<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VyvtdagiaoHytlxFfXalVRMig0d\">\u0110\u1ec3 y\u00eau c\u1ea7u x\u00f3a t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u1eed l\u00fd th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o v\u00ed ShopeePay c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh \u0111\u00e1p \u1ee9ng \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 b\u1ed1n \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n ti\u00ean quy\u1ebft sau \u0111\u00e2y.<\/div>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FNFqdAP4uo6Q92xxBeTlNdIXgR2\" start=\"1\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3\"><strong>R\u00fat to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 s\u1ed1 d\u01b0 v\u1ec1 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng<\/strong><\/h3>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ImNMdUtEsoodOxxW0ZhlaILegSJ\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5645\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5645\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5645\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Rut-toan-bo-so-du-ve-tai-khoan-ngan-hang.png\" alt=\"R\u00fat to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 s\u1ed1 d\u01b0 v\u1ec1 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Rut-toan-bo-so-du-ve-tai-khoan-ngan-hang.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Rut-toan-bo-so-du-ve-tai-khoan-ngan-hang-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Rut-toan-bo-so-du-ve-tai-khoan-ngan-hang-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Rut-toan-bo-so-du-ve-tai-khoan-ngan-hang-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Rut-toan-bo-so-du-ve-tai-khoan-ngan-hang-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5645\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>R\u00fat to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 s\u1ed1 d\u01b0 v\u1ec1 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Qh1ydMyyyoZDCSxd3kLlg8nqgjf\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AMRcd2JczounDlxdXxxlNsQFgNf\">S\u1ed1 d\u01b0 trong v\u00ed ShopeePay c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n ph\u1ea3i b\u1eb1ng 0 VN\u0110. Tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n y\u00eau c\u1ea7u x\u00f3a, h\u00e3y ch\u1eafc ch\u1eafn r\u1eb1ng b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 r\u00fat h\u1ebft to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 s\u1ed1 ti\u1ec1n c\u00f2n l\u1ea1i v\u1ec1 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u00e3 li\u00ean k\u1ebft.<\/div>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Qw9ydoJhkonvLLxIt3dlX92egXe\" start=\"2\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3\"><strong>H\u1ee7y li\u00ean k\u1ebft t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 c\u00e1c th\u1ebb\/t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng<\/strong><\/h3>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OjWId78VKow33FxM5yOlsuvEgqg\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_5646\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5646\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5646\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Huy-lien-ket-ShopeePay-tat-ca-cac-the-tai-khoan-ngan-hang.png\" alt=\"H\u1ee7y li\u00ean k\u1ebft ShopeePay t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 c\u00e1c th\u1ebb\/t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Huy-lien-ket-ShopeePay-tat-ca-cac-the-tai-khoan-ngan-hang.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Huy-lien-ket-ShopeePay-tat-ca-cac-the-tai-khoan-ngan-hang-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Huy-lien-ket-ShopeePay-tat-ca-cac-the-tai-khoan-ngan-hang-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Huy-lien-ket-ShopeePay-tat-ca-cac-the-tai-khoan-ngan-hang-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Huy-lien-ket-ShopeePay-tat-ca-cac-the-tai-khoan-ngan-hang-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5646\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>H\u1ee7y li\u00ean k\u1ebft ShopeePay t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 c\u00e1c th\u1ebb\/t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YuU3dsAGGoeHeRxid4Rl3ey3gIe\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OU0PdSIZ2okpMuxrKiSlbQK3gnf\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YWIOdUqUnotA6NxU6kBlLoLxgXf\">T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ShopeePay c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c li\u00ean k\u1ebft v\u1edbi b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 th\u1ebb t\u00edn d\u1ee5ng\/ghi n\u1ee3 hay t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng n\u00e0o. B\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n v\u00e0o m\u1ee5c &#8220;C\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t&#8221; c\u1ee7a v\u00ed v\u00e0 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n thao t\u00e1c h\u1ee7y li\u00ean k\u1ebft t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 c\u00e1c t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n \u0111\u00e3 th\u00eam tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u00f3.<\/div>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JXBZdchORo6P70xTNwElGROPgth\" start=\"3\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3\"><strong>Kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 giao d\u1ecbch n\u00e0o \u0111ang ch\u1edd x\u1eed l\u00fd<\/strong><\/h3>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HMA5da9QlohkdcxfM88l3aptgTf\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5647\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5647\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5647\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Khong-co-giao-dich-nao-dang-cho-xu-ly.png\" alt=\"Kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 giao d\u1ecbch n\u00e0o \u0111ang ch\u1edd x\u1eed l\u00fd\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Khong-co-giao-dich-nao-dang-cho-xu-ly.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Khong-co-giao-dich-nao-dang-cho-xu-ly-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Khong-co-giao-dich-nao-dang-cho-xu-ly-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Khong-co-giao-dich-nao-dang-cho-xu-ly-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Khong-co-giao-dich-nao-dang-cho-xu-ly-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5647\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>Kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 giao d\u1ecbch n\u00e0o \u0111ang ch\u1edd x\u1eed l\u00fd<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UsmWdFDIFoULDLxwT0BlpGOegkh\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-So18dUYTsogghvxXRj5l7T8qgug\">V\u00ed c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n ph\u1ea3i \u1edf tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i &#8220;t\u0129nh&#8221;, ngh\u0129a l\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 giao d\u1ecbch n\u00e0o \u0111ang ch\u1edd x\u1eed l\u00fd. \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y bao g\u1ed3m c\u00e1c giao d\u1ecbch n\u1ea1p ti\u1ec1n, r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n, thanh to\u00e1n \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng ho\u1eb7c chuy\u1ec3n ti\u1ec1n ch\u01b0a ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t.<\/div>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JwYYdwWGZoUIhIxCGCBl6G0ngph\" start=\"4\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3\"><strong>V\u00ed ShopeePay \u0111ang \u1edf tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng b\u00ecnh th\u01b0\u1eddng<\/strong><\/h3>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LiyYdiOSFovS4Tx91YGlw2Ezgrf\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-MyEvdek6PoFDqFxQbokl7s0YgWb\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;2a0db100-17ad-429f-8f5c-c1cc8b956404&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FTeDzbPj0doCCAVxxWaalRRpwgtG%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;TeDzbPj0doCCAVxxWaalRRpwgtG&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1018130,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5648\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5648\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5648\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Vi-ShopeePay-dang-o-trang-thai-hoat-dong-binh-thuong.png\" alt=\"V\u00ed ShopeePay \u0111ang \u1edf tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng b\u00ecnh th\u01b0\u1eddng\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Vi-ShopeePay-dang-o-trang-thai-hoat-dong-binh-thuong.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Vi-ShopeePay-dang-o-trang-thai-hoat-dong-binh-thuong-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Vi-ShopeePay-dang-o-trang-thai-hoat-dong-binh-thuong-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Vi-ShopeePay-dang-o-trang-thai-hoat-dong-binh-thuong-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Vi-ShopeePay-dang-o-trang-thai-hoat-dong-binh-thuong-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5648\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>V\u00ed ShopeePay \u0111ang \u1edf tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng b\u00ecnh th\u01b0\u1eddng<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PrRLdyAyCogeb0xkK9llclP3g20\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BQ9hdaJ2LofzSixSe0UluGCvgk5\">T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n ph\u1ea3i \u0111ang ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng b\u00ecnh th\u01b0\u1eddng. N\u00f3 kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c trong t\u00ecnh tr\u1ea1ng b\u1ecb kh\u00f3a, \u0111\u00f3ng b\u0103ng t\u1ea1m th\u1eddi, ho\u1eb7c \u0111ang trong qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh \u0111i\u1ec1u tra v\u00ec b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 l\u00fd do n\u00e0o li\u00ean quan \u0111\u1ebfn b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt hay tranh ch\u1ea5p.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C5Widih9Vogp8rx0lk3lDlWpgxc\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-G4FNdkf0gokWs4xDYi2lBOkagyg\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn c\u00e1ch x\u00f3a t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ShopeePay chi ti\u1ebft<\/h2>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DV6ZdnqzoonK0wxswcjlYwPdgHh\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5649\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5649\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5649\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Huong-dan-cach-xoa-tai-khoan-ShopeePay-chi-tiet.png\" alt=\"H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn c\u00e1ch x\u00f3a t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ShopeePay chi ti\u1ebft\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Huong-dan-cach-xoa-tai-khoan-ShopeePay-chi-tiet.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Huong-dan-cach-xoa-tai-khoan-ShopeePay-chi-tiet-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Huong-dan-cach-xoa-tai-khoan-ShopeePay-chi-tiet-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Huong-dan-cach-xoa-tai-khoan-ShopeePay-chi-tiet-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Huong-dan-cach-xoa-tai-khoan-ShopeePay-chi-tiet-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5649\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn c\u00e1ch x\u00f3a t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ShopeePay chi ti\u1ebft<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K2nfdNZONouBmBxfXCdlAr7ZgDh\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DinPdpmAGoAAaYxqVwOlFoEegHe\">Sau khi \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o \u0111\u1ee7 4 \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n tr\u00ean, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 li\u00ean h\u1ec7 v\u1edbi b\u1ed9 ph\u1eadn CSKH qua m\u1ed9t trong hai c\u00e1ch sau:<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-UK3Vd7D7VoV8wNxtgWbl7vRVgpb\">C\u00e1ch 1: Y\u00eau c\u1ea7u x\u00f3a qua t\u1ed5ng \u0111\u00e0i CSKH 1900 6906<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Fg4zd5L9MoCpkux69gNlQj4ngmb\">\u0110\u00e2y \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c xem l\u00e0 ph\u01b0\u01a1ng ph\u00e1p nhanh ch\u00f3ng v\u00e0 tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp nh\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ec3 y\u00eau c\u1ea7u x\u00f3a t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n.<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ir1MdrdDzoOUkcxHmZ3lTo3ggHq\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: Chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb th\u00f4ng tin x\u00e1c minh<\/strong> Tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi g\u1ecdi, h\u00e3y chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb s\u1eb5n c\u00e1c th\u00f4ng tin c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd v\u1edbi ShopeePay \u0111\u1ec3 qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh x\u00e1c minh di\u1ec5n ra nhanh ch\u00f3ng. C\u00e1c th\u00f4ng tin n\u00e0y bao g\u1ed3m:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X4zJd9rsdogBuOx5YNMlsdSNgGb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>H\u1ecd v\u00e0 t\u00ean \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 c\u1ee7a ch\u1ee7 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JT0Qd05ZUo7E3uxQWQglyshegpc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>S\u1ed1 CMND\/CCCD \u0111\u00e3 d\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ec3 x\u00e1c minh v\u00ed.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CnaDdr313oxrU8x5rIplRnI8gpb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>S\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd v\u00ed ShopeePay.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PaWcd5n7zohgtHxdYH6lD3Y6gLh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: G\u1ecdi \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1ed5ng \u0111\u00e0i v\u00e0 tr\u00ecnh b\u00e0y y\u00eau c\u1ea7u<\/strong> H\u00e3y g\u1ecdi \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ed1 <strong>1900 6906<\/strong> (c\u01b0\u1edbc ph\u00ed 1.000\u0111\/ph\u00fat). Sau khi k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u1edbi nh\u00e2n vi\u00ean h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3, b\u1ea1n h\u00e3y tr\u00ecnh b\u00e0y r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng v\u00e0 tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp y\u00eau c\u1ea7u c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh l\u00e0: &#8220;T\u00f4i mu\u1ed1n y\u00eau c\u1ea7u x\u00f3a v\u0129nh vi\u1ec5n t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ShopeePay&#8221;.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XDGsdHK0Wo6SO0x4kZ7lOdqWgTb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: Cung c\u1ea5p th\u00f4ng tin v\u00e0 x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn<\/strong> Nh\u00e2n vi\u00ean CSKH s\u1ebd y\u00eau c\u1ea7u b\u1ea1n cung c\u1ea5p c\u00e1c th\u00f4ng tin \u0111\u00e3 chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb \u1edf B\u01b0\u1edbc 1 \u0111\u1ec3 x\u00e1c th\u1ef1c b\u1ea1n l\u00e0 ch\u00ednh ch\u1ee7. Sau khi x\u00e1c minh th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng, nh\u00e2n vi\u00ean s\u1ebd th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o l\u1ea1i m\u1ed9t l\u1ea7n n\u1eefa v\u1ec1 vi\u1ec7c x\u00f3a t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n l\u00e0 v\u0129nh vi\u1ec5n v\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 kh\u00f4i ph\u1ee5c, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn ti\u1ebfp nh\u1eadn y\u00eau c\u1ea7u c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-N2RRdeztConUSRxpjzYlnOWLg3e\">C\u00e1ch 2: G\u1eedi bi\u1ec3u m\u1eabu y\u00eau c\u1ea7u h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 qua Email<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BDtHdRb09ozqB6x8YYQlOXLggme\">N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n kh\u00f4ng ti\u1ec7n g\u1ecdi \u0111i\u1ec7n, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 g\u1eedi y\u00eau c\u1ea7u b\u1eb1ng v\u0103n b\u1ea3n th\u00f4ng qua bi\u1ec3u m\u1eabu ho\u1eb7c email h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 c\u1ee7a Shopee.<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FNNtdaSSAoztNlx7TMVl069pgke\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: Truy c\u1eadp Trung t\u00e2m Tr\u1ee3 gi\u00fap c\u1ee7a Shopee<\/strong> Trong \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng Shopee, v\u00e0o tab <strong>&#8220;T\u00f4i&#8221;<\/strong> &gt; k\u00e9o xu\u1ed1ng v\u00e0 ch\u1ecdn <strong>&#8220;Trung t\u00e2m Tr\u1ee3 gi\u00fap&#8221;<\/strong>. T\u1ea1i \u0111\u00e2y, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u00ecm th\u1ea5y t\u00f9y ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u1ec3 g\u1eedi email ho\u1eb7c \u0111i\u1ec1n v\u00e0o bi\u1ec3u m\u1eabu li\u00ean h\u1ec7.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NGo2dqPXOowNWtxqzbol08lSgFb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: So\u1ea1n n\u1ed9i dung y\u00eau c\u1ea7u x\u00f3a t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n<\/strong> \u0110\u1ec3 y\u00eau c\u1ea7u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u1eed l\u00fd ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c v\u00e0 nhanh ch\u00f3ng, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n so\u1ea1n m\u1ed9t email ho\u1eb7c n\u1ed9i dung trong bi\u1ec3u m\u1eabu th\u1eadt r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 th\u00f4ng tin. B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng m\u1eabu sau:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NcvldRvbbo3gBvx8Cgulg7vqgGg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Ti\u00eau \u0111\u1ec1:<\/strong> Y\u00eau c\u1ea7u x\u00f3a v\u0129nh vi\u1ec5n t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ShopeePay<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T8induUmhoaFdNxMXL5lcB7hgkm\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>N\u1ed9i dung:<\/strong> K\u00ednh g\u1eedi B\u1ed9 ph\u1eadn h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 ShopeePay, T\u00f4i vi\u1ebft email n\u00e0y \u0111\u1ec3 y\u00eau c\u1ea7u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 x\u00f3a v\u0129nh vi\u1ec5n t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n v\u00ed ShopeePay c\u1ee7a t\u00f4i. T\u00f4i \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u1ecdc k\u1ef9 c\u00e1c \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n v\u00e0 x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u1ee7a t\u00f4i \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u00e1p \u1ee9ng \u0111\u1ee7 c\u00e1c y\u00eau c\u1ea7u (s\u1ed1 d\u01b0 b\u1eb1ng 0, \u0111\u00e3 h\u1ee7y li\u00ean k\u1ebft ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng,&#8230;). Th\u00f4ng tin t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u1ee7a t\u00f4i nh\u01b0 sau:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet3\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wno9dMR6BoqfEgxoy6slfHxkgwc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>H\u1ecd v\u00e0 t\u00ean \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7: [\u0110i\u1ec1n h\u1ecd t\u00ean c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n]<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jx0HdLzX0oUnJJxXhHslVrzigjh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>S\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd v\u00ed: [\u0110i\u1ec1n S\u0110T c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n]<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mi3udNdGLo8DkBxrw5WlXbH5ggh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>S\u1ed1 CMND\/CCCD \u0111\u00e3 x\u00e1c minh: [\u0110i\u1ec1n s\u1ed1 CMND\/CCCD c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n]<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JWzEdnpMwo3xY8xvZaFlWTQtgue\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>L\u00fd do y\u00eau c\u1ea7u x\u00f3a: [N\u00eau ng\u1eafn g\u1ecdn l\u00fd do, v\u00ed d\u1ee5: Kh\u00f4ng c\u00f2n nhu c\u1ea7u s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng] T\u00f4i xin cam \u0111oan c\u00e1c th\u00f4ng tin tr\u00ean l\u00e0 ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c v\u00e0 ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 y\u00eau c\u1ea7u n\u00e0y. Xin ch\u00e2n th\u00e0nh c\u1ea3m \u01a1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FjV5dtDjqoNjnjxCy4plrQVqg7d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: G\u1eedi v\u00e0 ch\u1edd ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i<\/strong> Sau khi g\u1eedi y\u00eau c\u1ea7u, h\u00e3y ki\u00ean nh\u1eabn ch\u1edd \u0111\u1ee3i ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i t\u1eeb \u0111\u1ed9i ng\u0169 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 qua email. H\u1ecd c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1ebd y\u00eau c\u1ea7u b\u1ea1n cung c\u1ea5p th\u00eam th\u00f4ng tin n\u1ebfu c\u1ea7n thi\u1ebft tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi ti\u1ebfn h\u00e0nh x\u00f3a t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AY6vdoyzpom7PDxwlDllWpZbg7f\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-RYz8dRuT1olvVBxQe1zloEZngQf\">Gi\u1ea3i \u0111\u00e1p c\u00e1c c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p khi x\u00f3a v\u00ed ShopeePay<\/h2>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-X57jdJfKDozLRxxcDfhlsrlYgAd\">X\u00f3a t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Shopee th\u00ec v\u00ed ShopeePay c\u00f3 b\u1ecb x\u00f3a theo kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NskzdBQKtosGHkxuJjglM25EgYb\">C\u00f3. V\u00ed ShopeePay \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c li\u00ean k\u1ebft tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp v\u1edbi t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Shopee c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n. Do \u0111\u00f3, khi b\u1ea1n th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n thao t\u00e1c x\u00f3a v\u0129nh vi\u1ec5n t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n mua s\u1eafm Shopee, v\u00ed ShopeePay li\u00ean k\u1ebft c\u0169ng s\u1ebd b\u1ecb x\u00f3a theo.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-XC0rdcduboDFdGxYk8RlRjOagRe\">Sau khi x\u00f3a t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ShopeePay c\u00f3 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd l\u1ea1i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F8NPdjDm3oPWqgxYwtulgGkXg2b\">Kh\u00f4ng. Theo ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch c\u1ee7a ShopeePay, m\u1ed7i s\u1ed1 CMND\/CCCD ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e9p \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd v\u00e0 x\u00e1c minh cho m\u1ed9t t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n duy nh\u1ea5t. M\u1ed9t khi t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n \u0111\u00e3 b\u1ecb x\u00f3a v\u0129nh vi\u1ec5n, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng l\u1ea1i th\u00f4ng tin c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n \u0111\u00f3 \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd m\u1ed9t t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n m\u1edbi.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-Inwxdel07o2BpsxtVzzl54svgqe\">N\u1ebfu kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng n\u1eefa th\u00ec c\u00f3 c\u1ea7n x\u00f3a v\u00ed ShopeePay kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GbZvdnXS7obdWoxzgStlkyqvgsh\">Vi\u1ec7c n\u00e0y kh\u00f4ng b\u1eaft bu\u1ed9c nh\u01b0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c khuy\u1ebfn kh\u00edch v\u00ec l\u00fd do b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt. N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 \u00fd \u0111\u1ecbnh s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng v\u00ed n\u1eefa, vi\u1ec7c x\u00f3a t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n s\u1ebd gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 th\u00f4ng tin c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n v\u00e0 tr\u00e1nh c\u00e1c r\u1ee7i ro ti\u1ec1m \u1ea9n. Trong tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p b\u1ea1n kh\u00f4ng mu\u1ed1n x\u00f3a, \u00edt nh\u1ea5t h\u00e3y \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o r\u1eb1ng b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 h\u1ee7y li\u00ean k\u1ebft t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 c\u00e1c t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CTzydPkxnoTc1BxMgu3lyprBgsb\">Vi\u1ec7c x\u00f3a t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ShopeePay l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh quan tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea3o ng\u01b0\u1ee3c, \u0111\u00f2i h\u1ecfi b\u1ea1n ph\u1ea3i th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u00fang c\u00e1c \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n v\u00e0 quy tr\u00ecnh. H\u00e3y lu\u00f4n c\u00e2n nh\u1eafc k\u1ef9 l\u01b0\u1ee1ng v\u00e0 chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 c\u00e1c b\u01b0\u1edbc c\u1ea7n thi\u1ebft tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi li\u00ean h\u1ec7 v\u1edbi b\u1ed9 ph\u1eadn h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3. \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 gi\u00fap y\u00eau c\u1ea7u c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u1eed l\u00fd nhanh ch\u00f3ng m\u00e0 c\u00f2n \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o an to\u00e0n tuy\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed1i cho th\u00f4ng tin t\u00e0i ch\u00ednh c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"QwP3dgQVKoACfDxytbelThdEgQe\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F0tBdWKc9ouVMkxbISmlScgIgif\">\n<div data-page-id=\"V0Kidqy2IocGzOxLzIxlADkBgoc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FnMpdlmeroUMmBxzO45lyb2Lg8f\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CiNPdL9yGogrOWx5SP9lClWZgQe\"><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BXbIdAJxhoMK78xlitmlwna7gJi\"><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D4zHdkc9moG0p4xCDsMlPfuCgLg\"><strong>Email: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I1zOdpTlKoctbZx2CeclelbEgNe\"><strong>Website: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PLSVdBWXkoC8WCxZhallVoJrgfc\"><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>V\u00ec m\u1ed9t l\u00fd do c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n n\u00e0o \u0111\u00f3, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 mu\u1ed1n t\u00ecm c\u00e1ch xo\u00e1 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ShopeePay c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch d\u1ee9t \u0111i\u1ec3m. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t thao t\u00e1c quan tr\u1ecdng li\u00ean quan tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp \u0111\u1ebfn th\u00f4ng tin t\u00e0i ch\u00ednh c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u00f2i h\u1ecfi s\u1ef1 c\u1ea9n tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 tu\u00e2n th\u1ee7 \u0111\u00fang quy tr\u00ecnh. Vi\u1ec7c qu\u1ea3n [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":5727,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[30,1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-5643","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-kien-thuc-shopee","category-tin-tuc"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5643","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/5"}],"replie